sequenceDiagram
    participant U as Researcher
    participant A as API
    participant D as PostgreSQL
    participant W as Worker
    U->>A: Submit version
    A->>D: Check project, source and duplicate hash
    A-->>U: Accepted with job ID
    W->>D: Claim next queued job with SKIP LOCKED
    W->>W: Parse, normalize, split and encode
    W->>D: Commit original, offsets, vectors and job state
    U->>A: Read ingestion status
    A-->>U: Queued, done or failed
